### Finish a workout (send it again with the same id and it is returned, not saved twice)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "id": "6f1c2b0e-4d7a-4a51-9a3e-2b8f0c1d9e47",
  "startedAt": "2026-06-01T09:00:00+01:00",
  "endedAt": "2026-06-01T10:00:00+01:00",
  "notes": "Pull day",
  "sets": [
    { "exerciseId": 1, "reps": 8, "weight": 0 },
    { "exerciseId": 1, "reps": 6, "weight": 0 }
  ]
}

### Get weekly volume
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analytics/weekly-volume?weekStart=2026-01-26&timeZone=Europe/London

### Get AI Coaching Recommendation (auto-fetch recent workouts)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/coach/recommend?numWorkouts=5&userGoals=strength&fitnessLevel=intermediate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get AI Coaching Recommendation (manual workout data)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/coach/recommend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "recentWorkouts": [
    {
      "date": "2026-05-15",
      "exercises": [
        {
          "name": "Bench Press",
          "category": "chest",
          "totalSets": 4,
          "averageReps": 8,
          "averageWeight": 225,
          "averageRPE": 8
        },
        {
          "name": "Incline Dumbbell Press",
          "category": "chest",
          "totalSets": 3,
          "averageReps": 10,
          "averageWeight": 60,
          "averageRPE": 7
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "userGoals": "build muscle and increase strength",
  "fitnessLevel": "intermediate"
}
